    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（中甲），非普通</em><br />穿着這套護甲期間，你可以以附贈動作讓這套護甲向四周釋放出劇毒的孢子，孢子將充滿以你爲中心的10尺半徑球狀區域。任何在這片區域內的生物都必須通過一次[[/save ability=con dc=15]]豁免，豁免失敗將陷入 <strong>中毒Poisoned</strong> 狀態，持續直至你的下一回合結束。此屬性一旦被使用，直到次日黎明前都無法被再次使用。</p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE:char;MARGIN:2pt 0cm 10pt\"><span class=\"GramE\">半身板甲主要</span>由覆蓋着裝者身體大部分的鑄模金屬板組成。不過，其腿部防護則只有由皮條繫住的簡單護<span class=\"GramE\">脛</span>。</p></div></div><p>While wearing this armor, you can take a bonus action to make the armor emit poisonous spores, which fill a 10-foot-radius sphere centered on yourself. Each creature in that area must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=15]] saving throw or have the poisoned condition until the end of your next turn. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p><p>Half plate consists of shaped metal plates that cover most of the wearer's body. It does not include leg protection beyond simple greaves that are attached with leather straps.</p></div>",
